  "title": "Cafeteria Macaroni and Cheese",
  "description": "A creamy casserole of macaroni and Cheddar cheese gets a wake-up call from mustard, Worcestershire sauce and a dash of hot sauce. Cheese, buttery bread crumbs and paprika are sprinkled over the top.",
  "authors": [
    "Karena"
  ],
